    "0 exact semantic duplicates",
    "<=2 per independently supported semantic family in the bank",
    "same-family paired wording must add justified value-relevant information",
    "cross-axis confounding and asymmetry screened",
    "research-only C/D comparison pairs not counted as validated scored items",
    "do not make up extra families to fill 12",
    "approve semantic diversity before adjusting any randomizer or scoring"
  ],
